WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:12.978
It was late at night.

2
00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:15.979
A prison bus waited outside Metro City Prison.

3
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.601
A guard came out of the prison and looked around.

4
00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:23.623
"It's all clear.

5
00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:25.524
Bring out the prisoner."

6
00:00:27.265 --> 00:00:28.206
Another guard came out.

7
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.088
A clown in handcuffs stood next to her.

8
00:00:33.988 --> 00:00:36.349
Suddenly several figures jumped out of the darkness.

9
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:39.390
"Oh no!"

10
00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:40.630
the first guard cried.

11
00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.631
"More clowns!"

12
00:00:45.571 --> 00:00:48.732
"I am not looking forward to school today," Jack said.

13
00:00:48.752 --> 00:00:52.053
"We're going to be stuck in class all day!"

14
00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.374
Roxy and her friends were walking to school.

15
00:00:57.695 --> 00:00:58.735
Mara scratched her head.

16
00:00:58.755 --> 00:01:01.856
"I thought a magician was coming today.

17
00:01:02.848 --> 00:01:05.809
He was going to do a magic show for the entire school."

18
00:01:05.829 --> 00:01:10.070
"Didn't you get the email from Principal Penn last night?"

19
00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:10.850
Terrell asked.

20
00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:15.271
"The magician has the flu, so there's no show today."

21
00:01:16.872 --> 00:01:17.632
Mara frowned.

22
00:01:17.652 --> 00:01:19.272
"That stinks."

23
00:01:19.292 --> 00:01:22.913
"I hope the magician gets better soon," Jack said.

24
00:01:22.933 --> 00:01:26.334
"Maybe he can make all of our teachers disappear!"

25
00:01:27.455 --> 00:01:28.355
He and Terrell laughed.

26
00:01:30.675 --> 00:01:33.693
Mara shook her head and sighed.

27
00:01:33.713 --> 00:01:37.355
"Maybe we can get a magician to make you two disappear."

28
00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.278
Mara pretended to wave a magic wand at Terrell and Jack.

29
00:01:41.978 --> 00:01:43.920
"Abracadabra, poof!"

30
00:01:45.341 --> 00:01:46.121
Roxy laughed.

31
00:01:46.141 --> 00:01:48.523
"Now that would be funny!"

32
00:01:48.543 --> 00:01:51.825
"I'd like to see an escape act," Jack said.

33
00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:54.667
"Once I saw a guy escape on TV.

34
00:01:55.708 --> 00:01:57.630
He was tied up in a big glass tank.

35
00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.752
He had to escape before the tank filled with water!"

36
00:02:01.716 --> 00:02:03.797
Jack folded his arms and pretended to struggle.

37
00:02:05.377 --> 00:02:06.437
Terrell looked at Roxy.

38
00:02:06.457 --> 00:02:09.198
"Maybe Rocket Girl could come to our school.

39
00:02:10.159 --> 00:02:12.059
She could show off all her super powers.

40
00:02:12.979 --> 00:02:14.800
That would be the best show ever!"

41
00:02:18.881 --> 00:02:19.941
did Terrell look at me?"

42
00:02:20.201 --> 00:02:20.782
Roxy thought.

43
00:02:20.802 --> 00:02:23.923
"That would be pretty cool!"

44
00:02:24.163 --> 00:02:25.083
Mara said suddenly.

45
00:02:25.103 --> 00:02:27.023
"Yeah!" Jack said.

46
00:02:28.044 --> 00:02:28.784
Roxy shrugged.

47
00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.938
"I guess it would be cool," she said.

48
00:02:31.958 --> 00:02:36.142
"But I don't think Rocket Girl does school shows."

49
00:02:37.903 --> 00:02:39.524
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:02:41.206 --> 00:02:43.067
She stopped walking and opened her backpack.

51
00:02:44.208 --> 00:02:46.830
"Oh, um, did I remember my homework?"

52
00:02:48.472 --> 00:02:50.534
She waited until her friends had walked a little more.

53
00:02:51.514 --> 00:02:52.855
Terrell kept looking back at her.

54
00:02:52.876 --> 00:02:56.819
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered.

55
00:02:56.839 --> 00:02:57.960
"What's wrong?"

56
00:02:59.108 --> 00:03:00.449
"Bad news, Rocket Girl."

57
00:03:00.689 --> 00:03:02.269
The mayor looked very serious.

58
00:03:02.289 --> 00:03:06.691
"A dangerous criminal escaped from Metro City Prison late last night."

59
00:03:06.711 --> 00:03:08.872
"Who?" Roxy asked.

60
00:03:08.892 --> 00:03:14.274
"He's one of the most terrible, evil criminals in the city," Mayor Bloom said.

61
00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:17.236
"His name is Mr.

62
00:03:17.456 --> 00:03:20.537
Bubbles." Roxy raised an eyebrow.

63
00:03:20.557 --> 00:03:22.518
"His name is Mr.

64
00:03:22.598 --> 00:03:25.079
Bubbles?" Mayor Bloom nodded.

65
00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.020
Roxy shrugged.

66
00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:28.857
"Okay, Mayor.

67
00:03:29.158 --> 00:03:30.262
I'm on my way!"
